Upstream-Name: nexus
Source: https://github.com/DreiDe/nexus
Comment: nexus-web-terminal ships the unmodified upstream static build of ttyd
 (https://github.com/tsl0922/ttyd), downloaded at build time by debian/rules.
 It statically links libwebsockets, libuv, json-c, mbedtls and zlib.

